---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ProductDemo from '../components/ProductDemo.astro';
import QuotaPopover from '../components/QuotaPopover.astro';
import UsageChart from '../components/UsageChart.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const repo = 'https://github.com/FluentHaze/codex-pulse';
const releases = `${repo}/releases`;
const steps = [
 { number: '01', title: '移入应用程序', text: '打开 DMG，将 Codex Pulse 拖入「应用程序」。使用 ZIP 时，请先解压。', kind: 'install' },
 { number: '02', title: '先尝试打开一次', text: '双击 Codex Pulse。出现无法验证开发者的提示时，选择「取消」或「完成」。', kind: 'open' },
 { number: '03', title: '前往隐私与安全性', text: '打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性」，向下找到「安全性」。', kind: 'settings' },
 { number: '04', title: '点击「仍要打开」', text: '找到 Codex Pulse 被阻止的提示，按要求验证密码或 Touch ID，再次确认「打开」。', kind: 'allow' }
];
---
<Base>
  <header class="site-header"><nav class="nav-shell" aria-label="主导航"><a class="wordmark" href="#" aria-label="Codex Pulse 首页"><Mark size={29}/><span>Codex Pulse</span></a><div class="nav-links" id="nav-links"><a href="#overview">概览</a><a href="#features">功能</a><a href="#install">安装指引</a><a href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <Icon name="arrow" size={12}/></a></div><a class="button button-small" href="#download">免费下载</a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="展开导航" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links"><Icon name="menu"/></button></nav></header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="overview"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">为专注而生</p><h1>额度，心中有数。<span>专注，始终在线。</span></h1><p class="hero-description">在菜单栏看额度，在每一轮看用量。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-large" href="#download"><Icon name="download" size={19}/><span data-primary-download>下载 Mac 版</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#download"><span data-secondary-download>Windows 版</span><Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><p class="hero-meta">开源免费<span>·</span>macOS 与 Windows</p></div><ProductDemo/><div class="product-caption"><div class="platform-switch" role="group" aria-label="产品界面示意平台"><button type="button" data-platform-button="mac" aria-pressed="true">macOS</button><button type="button" data-platform-button="windows" aria-pressed="false">Windows</button></div><p>界面与用量数据为功能示意</p></div></section>
    <section class="features section-shell" id="features"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">轻巧，却很周到。</p><h2>少一点打断。<br/>多一点心中有数。</h2><p>把注意力留给创作，<br class="mobile-break"/>把额度与用量交给 Pulse。</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card menubar-feature"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-kicker">随时看一眼</span><h3>抬眼之间，<br/>额度尽知。</h3><p>剩余百分比常驻 Mac 菜单栏。<br/>移入展开，点击直达详情。</p></div><div class="menubar-art"><div class="feature-systembar"><Mark size={20}/><b>88%</b><span>◒　▰　周六 10:24</span></div><QuotaPopover/></div></article><article class="feature-card token-feature"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-kicker">每一轮都有迹可循</span><h3>每一轮，<br/>都看得清。</h3><p>查看输入、输出与缓存用量。<br/>从当日趋势，看到每轮细节。</p></div><div class="token-art"><div class="token-chart-card"><div class="token-chart-title"><div><small>本机已记录</small><h4>今日 Token 用量</h4></div><strong>12.8<span>k</span></strong></div><div class="chart-legend"><span>输入</span><span>输出</span><span>缓存</span></div><UsageChart/></div><div class="token-breakdown"><span><i></i>输入<b>8,640</b></span><span><i></i>输出<b>4,160</b></span><span><i></i>缓存<b>6,240</b></span></div></div></article></div><div class="feature-notes"><div><Icon name="clock" size={23}/><p><b>按你的节奏更新</b><span>自动刷新，关注额度窗口与重置时间。</span></p></div><div><Icon name="spark" size={23}/><p><b>临界时，提醒你</b><span>低额度与恢复通知，少一次意外打断。</span></p></div><div><Icon name="windows" size={22}/><p><b>两种桌面，一份从容</b><span>Mac 菜单栏，Windows 桌面悬浮窗。</span></p></div></div></section>
    <section class="privacy-section" id="privacy"><div class="section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">本机读取，安心专注。</p><h2>你的数据，<br class="mobile-break"/>留在你的电脑。</h2><p class="privacy-lead">通过本机 Codex 读取额度。<br/>不复制、不保存登录 Token，不发送模型对话。</p><div class="privacy-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="privacy-window left"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="privacy-window right"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="privacy-halo"></div><div class="shield"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 184"><defs><linearGradient id="shield-line" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#a4daff"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#148cff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#a4daff"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M80 7 148 32v55c0 40-43 73-68 89-25-16-68-49-68-89V32Z" fill="#1088ff16" stroke="url(#shield-line)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M80 15 141 37v50c0 35-37 65-61 81-24-16-61-46-61-81V37Z" fill="none" stroke="#429dff" stroke-opacity=".4"/></svg><Icon name="lock" size={55}/></div></div><div class="privacy-footnotes"><span><Icon name="check" size={16}/>账号额度通过本机 app-server 读取</span><a href={`${repo}#数据和连接`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看数据说明 <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="download-section section-shell" id="download"><img class="download-icon" src={`${base}assets/app.svg`} width="82" height="82" loading="lazy" alt="Codex Pulse 图标"/><p class="eyebrow">准备好，继续创造。</p><h2>让专注，<br class="mobile-break"/>多一点从容。</h2><p class="section-description">你的下一行代码，值得更专注的时刻。</p><div class="download-grid"><article class="download-card" data-download-card="mac-arm64"><Icon name="mac" size={28}/><h3>Mac · Apple Silicon</h3><p>M 系列芯片</p><a class="button" data-download="mac-arm64-dmg" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往 GitHub 下载 <Icon name="download" size={16}/></a><a class="download-alternative" data-download="mac-arm64-zip" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ZIP 压缩包 <Icon name="arrow" size={12}/></a></article><article class="download-card" data-download-card="mac-x64"><Icon name="mac" size={28}/><h3>Mac · Intel</h3><p>Intel 处理器</p><a class="button button-secondary" data-download="mac-x64-dmg" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往 GitHub 下载 <Icon name="download" size={16}/></a><a class="download-alternative" data-download="mac-x64-zip" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ZIP 压缩包 <Icon name="arrow" size={12}/></a></article><article class="download-card" data-download-card="win-x64"><Icon name="windows" size={28}/><h3>Windows</h3><p>x64 · 便携版</p><a class="button button-secondary" data-download="win-x64-exe" href={releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往 GitHub 下载 <Icon name="download" size={16}/></a><span class="download-alternative">下载后直接运行</span></article></div><p class="release-status" id="release-status" aria-live="polite">安装包与更新记录，请在 GitHub Releases 查看。</p><p class="download-prerequisite">需要已安装并登录 ChatGPT 账号的 Codex。<br/>Mac 版尚未经过 Apple 公证，首次打开请按下方指引操作。</p><a href="#install" class="text-link install-link">Mac 首次安装指引 <span>↓</span></a></section>
    <section class="install-section" id="install"><div class="section-shell"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">从下载到专注</p><h2>Mac 首次打开，<br/>只需这几步。</h2><p>当前使用本地签名，尚未经过 Apple 公证。<br/>仅在确认下载来源可信且文件未被篡改时操作。</p></div><div class="install-grid">{steps.map(step => <article class="install-card"><div class="step-heading"><span>{step.number}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3></div><p>{step.text}</p><div class:list={['step-art',`step-${step.kind}`]} aria-hidden="true">{step.kind === 'install' ? <><div class="mini-window-title"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Codex Pulse</span></div><div class="drag-demo"><img src={`${base}assets/app.svg`} width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" alt=""/><span>→</span><div class="applications-folder">A</div></div><div class="drag-labels"><span>Codex Pulse</span><span>应用程序</span></div></> : step.kind === 'open' ? <div class="open-notice"><Icon name="shield" size={32}/><b>无法验证开发者</b><span>Codex Pulse 尚未经过 Apple 公证。</span><div><i>取消</i><i>完成</i></div></div> : step.kind === 'settings' ? <div class="settings-demo"><aside><span>通用</span><span>外观</span><b><Icon name="shield" size={12}/>隐私与安全性</b></aside><div><h4>隐私与安全性</h4><span>安全性</span><i></i><i></i></div></div> : <div class="allow-demo"><Icon name="shield" size={26}/><b>安全性</b><p>已阻止 Codex Pulse 打开，<br/>因为无法验证开发者。</p><span class="allow-button">仍要打开</span></div>}</div></article>)}</div><p class="install-note"><Icon name="shield" size={18}/><span>若仍提示「已损坏」或没有「仍要打开」，请使用最新版并<a href={`${repo}/issues`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">反馈问题</a>。不需要关闭系统安全保护。</span></p><a class="text-link apple-guide" href="https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/102445" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple 官方操作说明 <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a></div></section>
    <section class="faq-section section-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">还有一些，你可能想知道。</p><h2>简单使用，<br/>清楚了解。</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>开始使用前，需要准备什么？<span>+</span></summary><p>先安装 Codex，并使用 ChatGPT 账号登录。Pulse 会自动查找本机 Codex 可执行文件；如果没有找到，可以在设置中手动选择路径。</p></details><details><summary>为什么用量数字与账单可能不同？<span>+</span></summary><p>额度以 Codex 服务端返回的窗口数据为准。Token 统计来自本机已记录的会话事件，可能不完整，也不等同于账单或全部设备的用量。</p></details><details><summary>Mac 上如何显示桌面悬浮窗？<span>+</span></summary><p>Mac 默认使用菜单栏显示额度。打开详情中的「偏好设置 → 悬浮窗」，开启「显示桌面悬浮窗」即可。菜单栏点击打开菜单，移入时展开额度卡片。</p></details><details><summary>它是 OpenAI 官方应用吗？<span>+</span></summary><p>Codex Pulse 是独立的开源项目，并非 OpenAI 官方产品，也与 Apple 没有隶属关系。你可以在 GitHub 查看源码、发布记录并反馈问题。</p></details></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer section-shell"><div class="footer-top"><a class="wordmark" href="#"><Mark size={25}/><span>Codex Pulse</span></a><div><a href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <Icon name="arrow" size={12}/></a><a href="#download">下载</a><a href="#install">安装指引</a><a href="#privacy">数据与隐私</a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>为专注而生。开源构建。</span><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Codex Pulse · 独立开源项目</span></div></footer>
  <script src="../scripts/site.ts"></script>
</Base>
